OL,3,AKing Charles, Macron and Burnham to
OL,4,Apreview Bayeux Tapestry display
OL,5,
OL,6,FKing Charles, French President Emmanuel
OL,7,FMacron and UK Prime Minister Andy
OL,8,FBurnham are to preview one of the
OL,9,Fblockbuster cultural events of the
OL,10,Fyear, when they get to view the Bayeux
OL,11,FTapestry at the British Museum.
OL,13,FThe visit on Wednesday comes ahead of
OL,14,Fthe medieval tapestry going on public
OL,15,Fdisplay in London from 10 September.
OL,17,FThe 70m (230ft) tapestry, originally
OL,18,Fembroidered in England but kept for
OL,19,Fcenturies in France, tells the story of
OL,20,Fthe Norman Conquest and the Battle of
OL,21,FHastings in 1066.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
