OL,3,AKing Charles, Macron and Burnham to
OL,4,Apreview Bayeux Tapestry display
OL,5,
OL,6,FPresident Macron said the loan of the
OL,7,Fnational treasure until July 2027 was a
OL,8,F"powerful symbol" of the close ties
OL,9,Fbetween the UK and France.
